OL,3,AThree takeaways from Trump's 'Super
OL,4,AIntelligence' summit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe meeting came as some tech
OL,7,Fexecutives and experts have called for
OL,8,Ftighter oversight of AI and a slowdown
OL,9,Fin developing the technology, citing
OL,10,Fconcerns about the potential risks it
OL,11,Fposes to humanity.
OL,13,FHere are three key takeaways from
OL,14,FTrump's tech summit at the White House.
